This project derives portions of its design and logic from agent-deck
(https://github.com/asheshgoplani/agent-deck), MIT License,
Copyright (c) 2025 Ashesh Goplani.

Ported logic includes: the [fork] config resolver semantics (tri-state
with_state / with_ignored accessors and the implication rule), the
guard -> anchor -> worktree-create -> materialize -> rollback fork
pipeline, the state-materialization command sequence (staged -> unstaged
-> untracked -> ignored), the git-state detection matrix, and the
branch / worktree naming schemes.

Source files containing ported logic carry an attribution header
referencing this NOTICE. The port source map (exact file:line references
into agent-deck) is recorded in RESEARCH.md.
